  "details": "Sometimes while I play on Desktop mode, I like to alt-Tab while the game is loading. However, the game keeps dragging the mouse to the middle of the VRChat window, causing problems like minizing the window in a corner, or other issues.\nIf ALT+TAB were to open the user menu, or did something similar while in a loading screen, it would make the desktop verson a lot easier to use, especially for those who like to pre-load worlds on desktop rather than wait a minute in VR.",
